{"id":"en_forgive-no-mercy","title":"Forgive? No Mercy","titleEn":"Forgive? No Mercy","description":"Ethan has walked in on his wife Claire Whitmore with his foster brother ninety-nine times. In a previous life, he let fury take over and exposed their affair, which cost him his marriage, his child, his family, and eventually his life, dying penniless of cancer. Given another chance on that same day, he chooses the opposite path and simply leaves. To him, love means nothing now; money is what counts. Yet Noah and his own mother are counting on him to lose control, so they bring back a woman from his past to set him up once more. This time he intends to keep the child and the fortune, and offer no forgiveness.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/forgive-no-mercy/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/forgive-no-mercy/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Playing Dumb","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djo9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_forgive-no-mercy_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djo9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_forgive-no-mercy_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djo9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_forgive-no-mercy_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djo9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_forgive-no-mercy_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djo9k/?pub=4occak","k